{0 Observe Lwt}

[observe-lwt] supplies the Lwt implementation of [Observe.Runtime.S].
It provides callback-local dynamic bindings, cleanup, and native
[Lwt.Canceled] handling without selecting a platform or performing I/O.

Use {!module:Observe_lwt.Runtime} with [Observe.Runtime.Make] when an
application needs a custom Lwt composition. Most Lwt applications on Unix can
use the ready [observe-lwt-unix] package instead.
